{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Y2ROLL is an N64-style minimalistic physics-based arcade-style marble rolling game that will take you back to the turn of the millennium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459420/extras/1.gif?t=1743174244\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalistic gameplay that is easy to pick up, with a very high skill ceiling and constant opportunities for skill expression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return to the 32bit console era</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant N64-style graphics and art direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soundtrack inspired by atmospheric/intelligent DnB music</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to pick up</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level simply asks you to reach the goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level can be played with a single analogue stick or WASD keys</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard to master</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Later levels will test the movement mastery of even genre veterans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay levels to try and earn elusive gold medal times</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play 100 levels across 8 worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hidden secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no hidden secrets.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom user levels for endless replayability with  our FOSS level compiler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459420/extras/4.gif?t=1743174244\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic